Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.98,0:02:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit slacking on! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, chore boys, wash the windows\Nwhen you're finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.98,0:02:13.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(732,0)\bord1.9\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(687,732,\1a&H00&)}The Trials of Koby-Meppo
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.98,0:02:13.24,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(732,0)\c&HE7E6E5&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Trials of Koby-Meppo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I can't stand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe can be the model chore boy if\Nhe wants, but why do I have to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if it weren't for that stupid Straw Hat\Nguy, none of this would have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's because of that straw\Nhat guy that I'm here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.20,0:02:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doing stupid chores instead\Nof living the good life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Helmeppo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.31,0:02:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you touching me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't blame\Neverything on Luffy like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it isn't his fault, he was\Njust doing the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.16,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a long time you could use your\Nfather's power to get through life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to work long and hard on\Nour own to accomplish our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know my dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday I'm going to be a\Ngreat officer in the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll chase bad guys and defend justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wimp like you becoming a\NMarine officer like my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way that will ever happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Luffy, I know that\NI can do anything that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided that long ago, and if I\Ndie fighting for it, it's alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided to be like\NLuffy and do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even risk my life, to\Nachieve my final goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now we can work hard\Nand reach our goals together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.40,0:03:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm going to listen to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.64,0:03:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck makes you think\Nyou can tell me what I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what could you have possibly learned\Nfrom that pathetic excuse for a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about Luffy like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything\Nbut try to help you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember asking for your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help that fool, will you please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop acting foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, you're calling me a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:03:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explosion earlier was from you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.46,0:04:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't kick you out of\Nthe Marines, did they, Kobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.56,0:04:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they actually allowed\Nus to stay enlisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we had to agree to\Nwork for free for 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting kicked out would\Nhave been so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will now inform you about\Nthe nature of our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Morgan is being sent to Marine\NHeadquarters to face a court-martial for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the crimes of military\Nexploitation and the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.02,0:05:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cruel and unusual treatment of civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.46,0:05:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to transfer the\Nprisoner to Vice Admiral Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reckless lowlife bums!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to defy my superiority!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Marine Captain Axe Han Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.84,0:05:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess it's really going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know that he deserves to\Nget court-martialed and all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it, given the stuff that he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But honestly, even after all\Nthat, I still respected him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.12,0:06:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kobe, do you think that\Nthey're going to execute him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should probably be ready for\Nsomething like that to happen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.18,0:06:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands on deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.38,0:06:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vice Admiral Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's Marine Vice Admiral\NGarp, the man they call the Fist.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(188,0)\pos(720,623.4)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx90\fscy90\bord4.9\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(143,188,\1a&H00&)}Vice Admiral Garp\NNavy Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(188,0)\pos(720,623.4)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx90\fscy90\bord0.3\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&\t(143,188,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Vice Admiral Garp\NNavy Headquarters
Dialogue: 3,0:06:39.92,0:06:43.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(188,0)\pos(720,623.4)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx90\fscy90\bord0\4a&HFF&}Vice Admiral Garp\NNavy Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a great hero of the seas who\Ntravels all over the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp, thank\Nyou for coming all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:07:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are pleased to deliver\NCaptain Morgan to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.26,0:07:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit tired because I've\Nbeen up for five days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are indeed a dedicated marine, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I've been trying to set a record for\Nthe most donuts eaten in a single sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sugar kept me going at first,\Nbut I've been at it for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.78,0:07:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I guess the lack of sleep\Nis starting to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, cut the sleeping act already
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone moves a muscle, I'll hack up\Nthis cabin boy and feed him to the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Daddy, why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, please stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember who your son is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:07:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you do something like that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.69,0:08:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I need with a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want now is freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cut him into a thousand\Npieces if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.94,0:08:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But... Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good riddance, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Load the cannon! Take game!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Target, 16 degrees starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.98,0:08:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Distance, 8263. Now, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you not to shoot! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a hostage on that boat! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but at least I won't be\Nguilty of abandoning my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I can fix this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll capture Morgan myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never be able to\Ncapture him by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's let him try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's either brave and dumb, or just dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm awake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what's all this noise about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was certain that monster had killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the men has been killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I slept\Nthrough something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.46,0:09:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Free at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world will be kneeling\Nat my feet again in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will rule the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.98,0:10:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world will quake in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now set our course to the west, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.64,0:10:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said set our course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't have any part in your plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma put everything on the\Nline trying to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.50,0:10:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He even risked getting kicked out of the\NMarines to help me, and they're his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fights for what he believes in\Nno matter what, and so could I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm going to capture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you too stupid to know\Nwhat you're up against, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can a useless piece of\Nscum like you hope to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time you learned your\Nplace, you pathetic insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not listening to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'm the one who's\Ngoing to decide how to live my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could someone like you possibly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.80,0:10:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are absolutely pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can a couple of pitiful insects like\Nyou expect to capture someone like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you even think about getting\Nin my way, I'll kill you both!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry it turned out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't we friends after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, Koby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little pests aren't worth the\Ntime it would take to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better never see your faces again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morgan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have let you sail\Naway from me alive today,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but someday I'm going to\Ncatch you, I promise you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday I'm going to capture you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive my poor supervision, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.20,0:11:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allowing the prisoner to\Nescape was inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After today, these two will be\Nkicked out of the Marines for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you are truly lost causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone who\Nwould take you in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But turning you loose would\Nonly burden the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.50,0:12:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to take you\Nwith me to Marine headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, Vice Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, you're actually going to take these\Ntwo chore boys with you to headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you two have a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to run away,\Nthis is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.98,0:12:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that I'd allow you to\Nget very far, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now, this certainly\Nhas been an interesting day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marine headquarters?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp can be\Nvery unpredictable at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:13:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pretty high up on the\Nfood chain though, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, very high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then those two must have been very promising\Nto have caught his attention like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you let them go\Nwithout saying goodbye, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still wanted to play\Nwith them some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.66,0:13:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wanted to talk to them more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was even learning how to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make them a yummy lunch next\Ntime they came over, but now I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even get to say\Ngoodbye before they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did they have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rick, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone now, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll come back after they've\Nbecome fine marine officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.36,0:14:07.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(732,855)\pos(720,727)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord4.9\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,732,\1a&H00&)\t(4695,5550,\1a&HFF&)}Navy Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:14:02.36,0:14:07.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(732,855)\pos(720,727)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord0.3\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&\1a&HFF&\t(0,732,\1a&H00&)\t(4695,5550,\1a&HFF&)}Navy Headquarters
Dialogue: 3,0:14:02.36,0:14:07.91,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(732,855)\pos(720,727)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\bord0\4a&HFF&}Navy Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to become\Nmarines by mopping floors?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you ever think that maybe this\Nis just a hobby that old geezer has?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a new hobby called tormenting\Npoor chore boys just for fun I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,telling you the old man's crazy\Nenough that it might be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you bird stop chiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.

